ic/converter/session.rs` 已新增：\n\n```rust\npub(crate) fn derive_conversation_identity(\n    req: &MessagesRequest,\n) -> (String, String, &'static str)\n```\n\n文件 `src/anthropic/websearch.rs`、`src/anthropic/handlers.rs` 已将派生出的 `agentContinuationId` 显式传入 MCP 调用。\n\n（五）任务 2 已完成代码\n\n文件 `src/kiro/token_manager.rs` 新增统一模型判断：\n\n```rust\nfn model_requires_opus(model: Option<&str>) -> bool {\n    model.is_some_and(|model| model.to_ascii_lowercase().contains(\"opus\"))\n}\n```\n\n文件新增统一候选谓词：\n\n```rust\nfn is_effective_candidate(\n    entry: &CredentialEntry,\n    requires_opus: bool,\n    allowed_ids: &[u64],\n) -> bool {\n    !entry.disabled\n        && (allowed_ids.is_empty() || allowed_ids.contains(&entry.id))\n        && (!requires_opus || entry.credentials.supports_opus())\n}\n```\n\n文件新增真实有效候选 API：\n\n```rust\npub(crate) fn effective_candidate_ids(\n    &self,\n    model: Option<&str>,\n    allowed_ids: &[u64],\n) -> Vec<u64> {\n    self.recover_expired_quota_disables();\n    let requires_opus = Self::model_requires_opus(model);\n    let entries = self.entries.lock();\n    entries\n        .iter()\n        .filter(|entry| Self::is_effective_candidate(entry, requires_opus, allowed_ids))\n        .map(|entry| entry.id)\n        .collect()\n}\n```\n\n文件 `src/kiro/provider.rs` 新增：\n\n```rust\nfn retry_plan(&self, model: Option<&str>, bound_ids: &[u64]) -> (Vec<u64>, usize, bool) {\n    let candidates = self.token_manager.effective_candidate_ids(model, bound_ids);\n    let max_retries =\n        (candidates.len() * MAX_RETRIES_PER_CREDENTIAL).min(MAX_TOTAL_RETRIES);\n    let small_pool = candidates.len() <= 1;\n    (candidates, max_retries, small_pool)\n}\n```\n\n任务 2 同时修复了 priority current 的 Opus 临时 fallback 污染问题，保证：\n\n```text\nFREE priority=0\nPRO  priority=1\nOpus   → 临时选择 PRO\nSonnet → 再次选择 FREE\n```\n\n（六）任务 3 最终代码：`Cargo.toml`\n\n文件 `Cargo.toml` 当前包含 Tokio 测试时间支持：\n\n```toml\ntokio = { version = \"1.0\", features = [\"full\", \"test-util\"] }\n```\n\nRED CR 曾将该 feature 位于正式依赖视为 Low，但用户只选择修复 Critical+High，因此该 Low 未修改。\n\n（七）任务 3 最终代码：`src/kiro/endpoint.rs`\n\n文件新增的最终方法为：\n\n```rust\n/// 返回指定候选账号范围内出现可用端点所需的最短时间。\npub fn earliest_throttle_remaining(&self, credential_ids: &[u64]) -> Option<Duration> {\n    if credential_ids.is_empty() {\n        return None;\n    }\n    let now = Instant::now();\n    let mut guard = self.inner.lock();\n    guard.retain(|_, until| *until > now);\n    if !guard\n        .keys()\n        .any(|(credential_id, _)| credential_ids.contains(credential_id))\n    {\n        return None;\n    }\n\n    let mut earliest = None;\n    for credential_id in credential_ids {\n        for name in EndpointName::ALL {\n            let Some(until) = guard.get(&(*credential_id, name)) else {\n                return Some(Duration::ZERO);\n            };\n            let remaining = until.saturating_duration_since(now);\n            earliest = Some(earliest.map_or(remaining, |value: Duration| value.min(remaining)));\n        }\n    }\n    earliest\n}\n```\n\n该方法的重要边界为：\n\n- 空候选列表返回 `None`。\n- 候选范围内没有任何活动桶返回 `None`，由掌握真实候选语义的 Provider 转换为零等待。\n- 候选范围内至少有一个桶记录但存在任一未封禁桶时返回 `Some(Duration::ZERO)`。\n- 所有候选四个桶都封禁时返回最短剩余时长。\n- 范围外账号更短的桶不参与计算。\n- 过期桶在同一把锁中惰性清理。\n\n对应测试当前先为账号 1 的四个端点写入 30 秒封禁，再将 Runtime 覆盖为 10 秒，验证最短剩余时间接近 10 秒；账号 2 的 1 秒桶不参与账号 1 计算；账号 3 只有 Ide 被封禁时返回 `Duration::ZERO`。\n\n（八）任务 3 最终代码：`src/kiro/provider.rs`\n\n文件新增 marker：\n\n```rust\npub(crate) const ALL_ENDPOINTS_THROTTLED_MARKER: &str = \"[ALL_ENDPOINTS_THROTTLED]\";\n```\n\n文件新增等待上限：\n\n```rust\n/// 单次请求等待端点恢复的总时限；独立于普通上游请求重试预算。\nconst MAX_ENDPOINT_RECOVERY_WAIT: Duration = Duration::from_secs(120);\n```\n\n文件 Tokio 导入改为：\n\n```rust\nuse tokio::time::{Instant as TokioInstant, sleep};\n```\n\n文件新增恢复延迟转换：\n\n```rust\nfn endpoint_recovery_delay(&self, model: Option<&str>, bound_ids: &[u64]) -> Option<Duration> {\n    let candidate_ids = self.token_manager.effective_candidate_ids(model, bound_ids);\n    if candidate_ids.is_empty() {\n        return None;\n    }\n    Some(\n        self.endpoint_registry\n            .earliest_throttle_remaining(&candidate_ids)\n            .unwrap_or(Duration::ZERO),\n    )\n}\n```\n\n文件新增单请求 deadline helper：\n\n```rust\nfn bounded_endpoint_wait(\n    deadline: &mut Option<TokioInstant>,\n    requested: Duration,\n) -> Option<Duration> {\n    let now = TokioInstant::now();\n    let deadline = *deadline.get_or_insert_with(|| now + MAX_ENDPOINT_RECOVERY_WAIT);\n    if now >= deadline {\n        return None;\n    }\n    Some(requested.min(deadline.saturating_duration_since(now)))\n}\n```\n\n文件 `call_api_with_retry` 的核心状态为：\n\n```rust\nlet mut throttled_in_request: Vec<u64> = Vec::new();\nlet mut endpoint_exhausted_ids: Vec<u64> = Vec::new();\nlet mut budget_used = 0;\nlet mut endpoint_wait_deadline: Option<TokioInstant> = None;\n```\n\n文件循环已从：\n\n```rust\nfor attempt in 0..max_retries\n```\n\n改为：\n\n```rust\nwhile budget_used < max_retries\n```\n\n文件每轮动态重新获取有效候选：\n\n```rust\nlet effective_ids = self\n    .token_manager\n    .effective_candidate_ids(model.as_deref(), bound_ids);\n```\n\n文件使用硬允许范围排除已确认端点耗尽账号：\n\n```rust\nlet selectable_ids: Vec<u64> = effective_ids\n    .iter()\n    .copied()\n    .filter(|id| !endpoint_exhausted_ids.contains(id))\n    .collect();\n```\n\n文件端点全封等待路径的最终控制流为：\n\n```rust\nif selectable_ids.is_empty() {\n    let Some(delay) = self.endpoint_recovery_delay(model.as_deref(), bound_ids) else {\n        anyhow::bail!(\n            \"{} effective_candidates={:?}\",\n            ALL_ENDPOINTS_THROTTLED_MARKER,\n            effective_ids\n        );\n    };\n    if delay.is_zero() {\n        endpoint_exhausted_ids.clear();\n        throttled_in_request.clear();\n        continue;\n    }\n    let Some(wait_duration) =\n        Self::bounded_endpoint_wait(&mut endpoint_wait_deadline, delay)\n    else {\n        anyhow::bail!(\n            \"{} effective_candidates={:?}\",\n            ALL_ENDPOINTS_THROTTLED_MARKER,\n            effective_ids\n        );\n    };\n    tracing::info!(\n        \"[ENDPOINT] 所有候选账号端点均在冷却，等待 {:.3}s 后重试\",\n        wait_duration.as_secs_f64()\n    );\n    sleep(wait_duration).await;\n    endpoint_exhausted_ids.clear();\n    throttled_in_request.clear();\n    continue;\n}\n```\n\n文件将普通限流和端点耗尽集合合并为 TokenManager 的软避让参数：\n\n```rust\nlet mut avoided_ids = throttled_in_request.clone();\nfor id in &endpoint_exhausted_ids {\n    if !avoided_ids.contains(id) {\n        avoided_ids.push(*id);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n文件将 `selectable_ids` 作为硬范围传入：\n\n```rust\n.acquire_context_sticky(\n    model.as_deref(),\n    &selectable_ids,\n    continuation_id.as_deref(),\n    &avoided_ids,\n)\n```\n\n文件保持上下文获取失败和 RPM 跳过消耗原普通预算：\n\n```rust\nbudget_used += 1;\n```\n\n文件只有真正选到端点后才消耗一次实际请求预算：\n\n```rust\nlet endpoint = match self.select_endpoint(&ctx.credentials, budget_used) {\n    Some(e) => e,\n    None => {\n        // 记录 endpoint_exhausted_ids，写入 marker，不增加 budget_used。\n        drop(_cred_permit);\n        continue;\n    }\n};\nlet attempt = budget_used;\nbudget_used += 1;\n```\n\n文件端点全封错误为：\n\n```rust\nlast_error = Some(anyhow::anyhow!(\n    \"{} credential={} endpoints=[{}]\",\n    ALL_ENDPOINTS_THROTTLED_MARKER,\n    ctx.id,\n    ids\n));\n```\n\n文件仍保留：\n\n```rust\nfn all_effective_candidates_avoided(...)\n```\n\n但生产调用已删除，仅有测试直接调用。最终 CR 将其列为 Low 死代码/重构项；用户没有选择 Low，因此当前保留。\n\n（九）任务 3 最终测试：`src/kiro/provider.rs`\n\n文件新增单请求 deadline 测试：\n\n```rust\n#[tokio::test(start_paused = true)]\nasync fn test_endpoint_wait_deadline_is_single_request_scope() {\n    let mut deadline = None;\n    assert_eq!(\n        KiroProvider::bounded_endpoint_wait(&mut deadline, Duration::from_secs(30)),\n        Some(Duration::from_secs(30))\n    );\n\n    tokio::time::advance(Duration::from_secs(119)).await;\n    assert_eq!(\n        KiroProvider::bounded_endpoint_wait(&mut deadline, Duration::from_secs(30)),\n        Some(Duration::from_secs(1))\n    );\n\n    tokio::time::advance(Duration::from_secs(1)).await;\n    assert_eq!(\n        KiroProvider::bound